<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (After a break of structure occurs price is likely to pull back to an area of support \(in an uptrend\) or resistance level \(in a downtrend\) before continuing on its respective trend. This is deemed a short corrective move after price makes its impulsive move up. Think of it as a little cool-off period where traders take profits and re-position themselves before the next leg in the trend. To find entries during these corrective phases I like to look for entries from supply & demand zones that align with the trend.)
/E (After a break of structure occurs price is likely to pull back to an area of support \(in an uptrend\) or resistance level \(in a downtrend\) before continuing on its respective trend. This is deemed a short corrective move after price makes its impulsive move up. Think of it as a little cool-off period where traders take profits and re-position themselves before the next leg in the trend. To find entries during these corrective phases I like to look for entries from supply & demand zones that align with the trend.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
