/ActualText (First things first... who's in currently in control of the market, Buyers or Sellers?)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
662 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (open up the timeframe 2 or more periods higher than the one your trading, I personally like the 4 hour or the daily. Once in the chart, identify whether price is making higher Highs \(buyers in control\), or lower lows \(Sellers in control\). If you need better clarification of the direction of trend, use the line tool to mark off an ascending or descending trendline.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
