665 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (3 - Aligning ourselves with the market:)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
666 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A key factor to why some traders are more successful than others is that the succesful ones are focussing on higher probability trades that have a greater chance of paying off, therefore having greater success. To adopt this method for yourself you'll want to align yourself with the momentum of the market. To achieve this identify entries into trades / trade set ups that align with the market in both the higher and lower timeframe. For example if you identify buyers being in control of the market look for entries into long trades in bullish structure.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
